"""Self-contained review player with scene navigation and explicit source context."""
import base64,html,json
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];folder=root/'videos/14-fabric-ontology-explained';shots=json.loads((folder/'work/shots.json').read_text());uri='data:video/mp4;base64,'+base64.b64encode((folder/'out/final.mp4').read_bytes()).decode();buttons=''.join(f'<button data-time="{s["start"]}">{s["start"]:.1f}s · {html.escape(s["scene"])}</button>' for s in shots)
page='''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Fabric ontology — reference adaptation</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{background:#20150f;color:#fff1dc;font:16px/1.6 system-ui;margin:0}main{max-width:1300px;margin:auto;padding:28px}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.15}p{color:#d8b995}video{width:100%;border-radius:16px;background:#000}nav{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}button{background:#1b373c;border:1px solid #648f89;color:#fff1dc;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 15px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left}a{color:#f5be6f}details{margin:22px 0}</style><main><p>REELFACTORY / EDITOR V1</p><h1>Microsoft Fabric ontology</h1><p>2:02 · 22 scenes · static presenter placeholders · original synthetic dialogue</p><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" src="'''+uri+'''"></video><details open><summary>Jump to a scene</summary><nav>'''+buttons+'''</nav></details><p>Adapted from the full supplied interview’s composition and editing structure, compressed to the earlier two-minute brief. Revised motion: persistent entity objects morph into detail views, connections draw with the narration, route highlights travel across the graph, and documentation details receive an eased camera push. Original diagrams and fictional people explain a retail shipment example. Animated example values are illustrative, not live Fabric query results.</p><p>Real UI excerpt: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XEyq1qL147M">Guy in a Cube: What Is Fabric IQ?!</a>, February 2026 preview. Source audio removed. Footage reuse permission is unconfirmed; this is a local attributed review draft, not a cleared public release.</p><p>Current facts and documentation image: <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/iq/ontology/overview">Microsoft Learn: Fabric ontology</a> · <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/fabric/iq/ontology/how-to-bind-data">Data bindings</a>. Documentation image <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>; scaled for this edit. Fabric ontology is in preview.</p></main><script>const v=document.querySelector('video');document.querySelectorAll('[data-time]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{v.currentTime=+b.dataset.time;v.play().catch(()=>{})});</script>'''
(root/'fabric-ontology-review.html').write_text(page);print('Packaged',round(len(page)/1048576,1),'MiB')
